    "text": "KCTV 5\nwebsite\nSedalia\nDriver taken to hospital after running red light, crashing into 2 other cars\nBy Sarah Motter,\n3 hours agoSEDALIA, Mo. (KCTV) - A Montreal man is recovering in an area hospital after he ran a red light and hit two cars in an oncoming lane of traffic in Sedalia. The Missouri State Highway Patrol indicates that around 3:30 p.m. on Tuesday, June 17, emergency crews were called to the area of Highway 50 at State Fair Blvd. with reports of a 3-vehicle crash.",
